{
  "description": "The telemetry_link spec (1.0) documents `412` (`components.responses.preconditionFailed`) and the `If-None-Match` header (`components.parameters.ifNoneMatch`) on the three create-or-update-*-telemetry-link operations, but convert drops header parameters and core's status map has no 412, so the header can't be sent and the failure surfaces as UnknownStackitError. STACKIT's Terraform provider (stackit/internal/services/telemetrylink/link/resource.go, read 2026-11-01) creates with IfNoneMatch(\"*\"). From the spec; no live probe: no credentials exist for this account.",
  "patches": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.telemetry_link#PreconditionFailed",
      "value": {
        "type": "structure",
        "members": {
          "message": {
            "target": "smithy.api#String"
          }
        },
        "traits": {
          "smithy.api#error": "client",
          "smithy.api#httpError": 412,
          "com.distilled.openapi#errorMatchers": [
            {
              "status": 412
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.telemetry_link#CreateOrUpdateProjectTelemetryLink/errors/-",
      "value": {
        "target": "com.stackit.telemetry_link#PreconditionFailed"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.telemetry_link#CreateOrUpdateProjectTelemetryLinkRequest/members/ifNoneMatch",
      "value": {
        "target": "smithy.api#String",
        "traits": {
          "smithy.api#httpHeader": "If-None-Match",
          "smithy.api#documentation": "Set to `*` so the call only creates a link, and fails with `PreconditionFailed` when one exists."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.telemetry_link#CreateOrUpdateFolderTelemetryLink/errors/-",
      "value": {
